SubmitCompleteLaboratoryReportCommand --> CreateMedicalRecognitionReportCommand : 报告不存在且首版有效时调用
SubmitCompleteLaboratoryReportCommand --> UpdateMedicalRecognitionReportCurrentVersionCommand : 后续完整版本形成时调用
SubmitCompleteLaboratoryReportCommand --> SupersedeMedicalReportVersionCommand : 后续完整版本形成时调用
SubmitCompleteLaboratoryReportCommand --> AppendMedicalReportVersionCommand : 新版本形成时调用
SubmitCompleteLaboratoryReportCommand --> RecordLaboratoryReportContentCommand : 新版本形成时调用
SubmitCompleteLaboratoryReportCommand --> AddLaboratoryResultItemCommand : 按普通结果逐条调用
SubmitCompleteLaboratoryReportCommand --> AddBacterialIdentificationResultCommand : 按细菌鉴定结果逐条调用
SubmitCompleteLaboratoryReportCommand --> AddDrugSusceptibilityResultCommand : 按药敏结果逐条调用
SubmitCompleteExaminationReportCommand --> CreateMedicalRecognitionReportCommand : 报告不存在且首版有效时调用
SubmitCompleteExaminationReportCommand --> UpdateMedicalRecognitionReportCurrentVersionCommand : 后续完整版本形成时调用
SubmitCompleteExaminationReportCommand --> SupersedeMedicalReportVersionCommand : 后续完整版本形成时调用
SubmitCompleteExaminationReportCommand --> AppendMedicalReportVersionCommand : 新版本形成时调用
SubmitCompleteExaminationReportCommand --> RecordExaminationReportContentCommand : 新版本形成时调用
SubmitCompleteExaminationReportCommand --> AddExaminationItemCommand : 按检查项目逐条调用
SubmitCompleteExaminationReportCommand --> AddExaminationSiteCommand : 按检查部位逐条调用
ProvideRecognitionCandidatesCommand --> QueryRecognitionCandidatesCommand : 查询并返回候选结果
ProvideRecognitionCandidatesCommand --> CreateRecognitionCandidateProviderGroupCommand : 候选非空时调用一次
ProvideRecognitionCandidatesCommand --> AddRecognitionCandidateItemCommand : 按候选项目逐条调用
SubmitRecognitionDecisionsCommand --> SaveRecognitionDecisionCommand : 整批校验通过后逐项调用
SubmitRecognitionDecisionsCommand --> MarkRecognitionCandidateProviderGroupDecidedCommand : 整组首次保存成功后调用
SubmitRecognitionReferencesCommand --> AddRecognitionReferenceCommand : 整批校验通过后原子逐项保存

